{"message": {"content": [{"content": "Web search results for query: \"Claude Code changelog latest version\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"# How to Check and Update Your Claude Code Version\",\"url\":\"https://www.fast.io/resources/claude-code-version-changelog-guide.md\"},{\"title\":\"AI & Agents\",\"url\":\"https://fast.io/resources/claude-code-version-changelog-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Claude FastClaude Fast\",\"url\":\"https://claudefa.st/blog/guide/changelog\"},{\"title\":\"Claude FastClaude Fast\",\"url\":\"https://claudefa.st/docs/learn/changelog\"},{\"title\":\"claude code changelog\",\"url\":\"https://www.claudelog.com/claude-code-changelog/\"},{\"title\":\"version check\",\"url\":\"https://tessl.io/registry/skills/github/ykdojo/claude-code-tips/version-check\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code Changelog & Release Notes\",\"url\":\"https://www.havoptic.com/tools/claude-code\"},{\"title\":\"www.issoh.co.jp\",\"url\":\"https://www.issoh.co.jp/md/tech/10625\"},{\"title\":\"claude code release notes\",\"url\":\"https://claudelog.com/faqs/claude-code-release-notes\"}]\n\nThe most recent version I found is **v2.1.263**, dated September 5, 2026, according to ClaudeLog's changelog page. I couldn't confirm it against Anthropic's official changelog, so treat it as provisional. Today is October 21, 2026, so newer releases may exist.\n\nThe ClaudeLog entry for v2.1.263 lists bug fixes and reliability improvements, and its synopsis mentions a new /skill-doctor command. Other sources in the results are older:\n\n- Havoptic reports v2.1.207 as the latest release as of July 10, 2026.\n- An issoh.co.jp article shows a version check run on August 30, 2026 that reported Claude Code as up to date (2.1.251).\n- The official docs changelog is at code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog. Anthropic's GitHub releases page is also listed as a source. I did not retrieve either directly.\n\nTo confirm the current version, check the official changelog or run `claude update` locally.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST i